  "format": "ai-tools",
  "script": "Five AI tools still free in September 2026. The question is where free stops.\n\nGoogle AI Studio is free in every region it's offered: Gemini's models, in a browser.\n\nGemini Notebook, the one you knew as NotebookLM, gives you fifty chats a day and three audio overviews. Since September second, those limits refresh every five hours, not once a day, so a heavy morning doesn't cost the evening.\n\nElevenLabs gives you ten thousand credits a month for speech, sound effects and music, enough for a few voiceovers, not a series. Cloning starts at six dollars.\n\nSuno gives fifty credits a day for music, but the free plan carries no commercial rights. Pro is eight.\n\nAnd GitHub Copilot's free plan is two thousand completions a month, no card. Pro is ten.\n\nBut these ceilings move. Copilot's changed more than once this year, so look it up first.\n\nComment TOOLS and the five links land in your DMs.",
